:''Attacks against unstarred Aliens are much more powerful!''
The '''Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures''' are a type of [[Treasure]] found in [[Into the Future]]. This group includes the [[Aqua Crystal]] and the [[Plasma Crystal]]. As their name suggests, they debuff [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred Aliens]], which makes them some of the most important Treasures in the game as [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] are massively buffed without them. However, they do not affect [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], which instead have [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures|their own Treasure sets]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]].

==Effect==
These Treasures decrease the initial 700% stat magnification applied to all [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|unstarred Aliens]]' base health and base attack power.

For example, a hypothetical unstarred Alien has base health and attack power of 1,000, but the default stat magnification applied to unstarred Aliens' base stats is 700%, making the enemy's health and damage per hit 7,000.

Each fully activated [[Aqua Crystal]] and [[Plasma Crystal]] [[Treasure]] set then reduces this 700% default magnification by 100% (subtractive) such that this example unstarred Alien's base attack power is always 1,000 but the default magnification effect applied to produce the enemy health and damage output is reduced as shown below.

